    "text": "I, Samanthi D. Nagahathanna, Divisional Secretary of the Divisionof Kundasale in Kandy District, in terms of Section 33 of the LandAcquisition Act (Chapter 460) hereby give notice that a sum ofRupees Eighty Seven Thousand and Three Hundred(Rs. 87,300.00) being compensation interest sum of Rupees SixThousand Seven Hundred Thirty Nine and Thirty Eight cents(Rs. 6,739.38) for the acquisition of the land described in the schedulebelow has been deposited under Case No. DLA/35/2013 in the DistrictCourt of Kandy to be drawn by the person entitled thereto.",
